// Hand-written `kafkajs` stub for the flowatlas fixture suite. It declares only
// what `fixtures/nest-kafka/src` touches, in the real library's shape.
//
// `kafkajs` in `package.json` is the first half of the `nestjs-kafka` detection
// rule (P04 §7); `Transport.KAFKA` in the source is the second. The package is
// therefore load-bearing for detection even though every producer and consumer
// in this fixture goes through `@nestjs/microservices`, which is installed for
// real in `fixtures/node_modules`.
//
// `PartitionerArgs` is typed loosely on purpose: the value is handed straight to
// `@nestjs/microservices`, which vendors its own copy of the kafkajs types, and
// a structurally exact re-declaration would only make the two copies fight.

